Day One of the NIF Global selection process for their students’ show at fashion week saw interior designer Aashna Chaudhry join Shefalee Vasudev, editor-in-chief, The Voice of Fashion, and creative entrepreneur Neeraj Gaba on the jury. Moderated by celebrity host Aakriti Anand, the session saw the jury select winners from among shortlisted interior design students, who will now have the chance to participate in The Runway showcase at the upcoming edition of Lakmē Fashion Week, in partnership with FDCI.

